      "line": 101,
      "raw_header": "theorem sharp_affine_absorption (a b c d C1 C2 C3 C4 : \u211d) (N n : Nat)\n    (contract : a + c < 1) (toll_nonneg : 0 \u2264 C1)\n    (threshold : (max 0 b + max 0 d + 2) / (1 - a - c) < (N : \u211d))\n    (slope : C1 / (1 - a - c) \u2264 C3)\n    (absorb : (C1 * (N : \u211d) + C2 + C4) /\n      ((1 - a - c) * (N : \u211d) - max 0 b - max 0 d - 2) \u2264 C3)\n    (large : N \u2264 n) :\n    (C3 * (a * (n : \u211d) + max 0 b + 1) + C4) +\n      (C3 * (c * (n : \u211d) + max 0 d + 1) + C4) + C1 * (n : \u211d) + C2 \u2264\n        C3 * (n : \u211d) + C4 ",
      "raw_header_sha256": "0ad2f527e3b62ccb414d16c5c8e8045eda84024a7b34c87f108c9d520a062cb5",
