      "line": 121,
      "raw_header": "theorem recurrence_step_le (f : Nat \u2192 \u211d) (a b c d C1 C2 C3 C4 : \u211d) (N n : Nat)\n    (ha : 0 \u2264 a) (hc : 0 \u2264 c) (contract : a + c < 1) (toll_nonneg : 0 \u2264 C1)\n    (threshold : (max 0 b + max 0 d + 2) / (1 - a - c) < (N : \u211d))\n    (slope : C1 / (1 - a - c) \u2264 C3)\n    (absorb : (C1 * (N : \u211d) + C2 + C4) /\n      ((1 - a - c) * (N : \u211d) - max 0 b - max 0 d - 2) \u2264 C3)\n    (large : N \u2264 n)\n    (recurrence : f n = f \u2308a * (n : \u211d) + b\u2309\u208a + f \u2308c * (n : \u211d) + d\u2309\u208a +\n      C1 * (n : \u211d) + C2)\n    (left_bound : f \u2308a * (n : \u211d) + b\u2309\u208a \u2264 C3 * (\u2308a * (n : \u211d) + b\u2309\u208a : \u211d) + C4)\n    (right_bound : f \u2308c * (n : \u211d) + d\u2309\u208a \u2264 C3 * (\u2308c * (n : \u211d) + d\u2309\u208a : \u211d) + C4) :\n    f n \u2264 C3 * (n : \u211d) + C4 ",
      "raw_header_sha256": "2f3f0fc1555abde361c8ff42fcc81e7ad2382c54344c964fac90b99529566cc3",
      "parent_raw_header_sha256": "2f3f0fc1555abde361c8ff42fcc81e7ad2382c54344c964fac90b99529566cc3",
